{"id":"2b8a73334f8550a1","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-kleene-first-pca.md","title":"部分递归应用构成 Kleene 第一组合代数","display":"thm-kleene-first-pca — 部分递归应用构成 Kleene 第一组合代数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-kleene-first-pca","aliases":["72-thm-kleene-first-pca"],"display":"thm-kleene-first-pca — 部分递归应用构成 Kleene 第一组合代数","depends_on":["[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]","[[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.3 PRO, print424/PDF436; s-m-n construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-kleene-first-pca"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-kleene-first-pca</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-first-pca — 部分递归应用构成 Kleene 第一组合代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a722d09fe9b7b184\" href=\"?note=a722d09fe9b7b184\" title=\"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra\">72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.3 PRO, print424/PDF436; s-m-n construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a> 的可接受编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCA}\">\\(\\operatorname{PCA}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a722d09fe9b7b184\" href=\"?note=a722d09fe9b7b184\" title=\"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra\">72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\Phi\">\\(G_\\Phi\\)</span> 由下式给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b,c\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle a,b,c\\rangle\\in\\omega^3:\\varphi_a(b)\\downarrow=c\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle a,b,c\\rangle\\in\\omega^3:\\varphi_a(b)\\downarrow=c\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists k,s\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{PCA}(\\omega,G_\\Phi,k,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists k,s\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{PCA}(\\omega,G_\\Phi,k,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>s-m-n 先为每个 a 总递归地产生常值程序索引，再选计算这个选码函数的 k；因此 K a b=a。两次参数化产生总递归的 S 前两步选码函数，第三步依次运行 a c、b c，再运行前者于后者，恰有相同停机条件与输出。K、S 不可能相同：若相同，则 S a b=a 对所有 a,b；从 S 方程将迫使任意部分递归函数满足 a c ≃ (a c)(b c)，取 a 为常值零程序、b 为处处未定义程序可得矛盾。编号的满枚举性保证这些所需程序存在。这里证明存在组合子，不将任意编号的选码函数错误地提升为原始递归。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a722d09fe9b7b184","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 的可接受编号 $\\Phi$；$\\operatorname{PCA}$ 使用 [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]。$G_\\Phi$ 由下式给出；$a,b,c\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a722d09fe9b7b184","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 的可接受编号 $\\Phi$；$\\operatorname{PCA}$ 使用 [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]。$G_\\Phi$ 由下式给出；$a,b,c\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCA}","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle a,b,c\\rangle\\in\\omega^3:\\varphi_a(b)\\downarrow=c\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists k,s\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{PCA}(\\omega,G_\\Phi,k,s).","display":true}],"bytes":1828,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,